msgid "Processing and plotting for rovibrational line lists (DAT2GR)"
msgstr "处理并绘制振转谱线列表（DAT2GR）"

msgid ""
"The DAT2GR program is intented to be used to read in rovibrational line "
"lists of infrared and Raman spectra, generated by the RCI and RVCI extension"
" of the VSCF and VCI program."
msgstr "DAT2GR 程序旨在读取由 VSCF 和 VCI 程序的 RCI 和 RVCI 扩展生成的、红外和拉曼光谱的振转谱线列表。"
